flowchart LR
    PLATFORM[Platform Team]
    SERVICE[user-service Team]
    ORG[organization-service Team]
    EXT[External Repo Teams]

    CORE["@your-org/fhir-core"]
    AWS["@your-org/fhir-aws"]
    PROFILES["@your-org/fhir-profiles"]

    PLATFORM --> CORE
    PLATFORM --> AWS
    PLATFORM --> PROFILES

    SERVICE --> PROFILES
    ORG --> PROFILES
    EXT --> PROFILES

    SERVICE -->|implements canonical models + endpoints| CORE
    ORG -->|implements canonical models + endpoints| CORE
    EXT -->|consumes published package| CORE
